# Ignore the timestamped reports produced by re-running the CSV demos; the
# committed tstx-*/tstc-*-report.html files are the stable reference copies.
tstx-*_*.html
tstc-*_*.html

# EODHD reports embed LICENSED market data (and the free `demo` token is for
# evaluation only), so they are NEVER committed — generate and view them
# locally. This ignores both the timestamped runs and the promoted stable copy.
# The committed reference reports are the synthetic-data CSV demos (CLAUDE.md §17).
eodhd-*_*.html
eodhd-*-report.html

# Timestamped CSVs produced by `wichtelm sweep` (CLAUDE.md §18). These are
# regenerable run artifacts, not reference copies, so they are not committed.
*_sweep_*.csv
